<<if $last_check_success>>
CONTENT

    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 7>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    CONTENT
    <<endif>>

<<endif>>

-> CONTENT
-> CONTENT
    <<form_set_occupation YarnManager "CONTENT">>

<<set $asked_occupation = true>>
<<jump EthanMiller_Hub>>
===

title: EthanMiller_Late_Pass
---
Bright-Eyed Young Patriot: Wow, sir, you really know your stuff! Technically, I'm a Junior Compliance Officer.
Bright-Eyed Young Patriot: How'd you get so good at what ya do?
-> Practice, mostly. 
-> I do as I'm told and I don't deviate.
-> When in doubt, I listen to the colored voices in my head.
===


title: EthanMiller_Late_Fail
---
CONTENT
